    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Crank hand drill with a turned wooden head grip, cast frame, red-painted main gear wheel, pinion, side crank with wooden knob, chuck and a modelled twist bit. Gear teeth are real geometry, visible in the top and bottom views, and rust and chipped paint are consistent across the frame. No cast-in maker's name.",
    "limitations": [
      "Not rigged in the shipped glTF: the crank and chuck do not rotate.",
      "The drill bit is fused to the chuck rather than interchangeable."
    ],
